# CRITERIA-BASED ASSESSMENT THE EFFECTIVENESS OF ADVANCED PROFESSIONAL TRAINING IN THE REGION

**Authors:** Viktor G. Lysenko

## Abstract
The present paper examines the author’s metho dologies for the creation of methodologically verifi ed and precisely defi ned instruments for evaluating the activities of the Centre for Advanced Professional Training. This evalua tion is based on a comprehensive system analy sis of the current trends in the education development, the priorities of socio- economic development of the region, the requests of stakeholders within the regional community, and external partners. The list of primary indicators and indicators pertai ning to the Centre’s functioning and development effi ciency is presented and described. The outlined methodologies for generating a criterion- based evalua tion of the activity of the Centre for Advanced Professional Training of Kuzbass, with a particular emphasis on the priori ties of socio- economic development of the region, based on close collaboration between the Centre and its partners, can be applied to the work of institutions of higher and secon dary vocational education

